{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100367","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100367/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100367/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100367/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100367","id":2738639242,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6FKNm0","number":100367,"title":"Optimize `SWAP` macro by using move semantics.","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"aaccff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/20","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/20","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/20/labels","id":10558797,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AoR1N","number":20,"title":"4.4","description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":8,"closed_issues":4466,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-02-14T11:52:07Z","updated_at":"2026-10-05T23:48:31Z","due_on":"2025-03-03T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-03-19T09:35:35Z"},"comments":1,"created_at":"2024-12-13T15:23:26Z","updated_at":"2024-12-14T19:11:32Z","closed_at":"2024-12-14T17:29:27Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/100367","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100367","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100367.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100367.patch","merged_at":"2024-12-14T17:29:27Z"},"body":"Move semantics help make code faster by changing ownership rather than copying objects. In the case of `SWAP`, a maximum of 3 copies can be avoided, if the underlying objects have corresponding constructors and assignment operators. The current implementation forces the compiler to copy the object for each assignment:\r\n\r\n```c++\r\ntemplate <typename T>\r\n inline void __swap_tmpl(T &x, T &y) {\r\n \tT aux = x;  // copy assignment\r\n \tx = y;  // copy assignment\r\n \ty = aux;  // copy assignment\r\n }\r\n```\r\n\r\nRecently, we starting to introduce `move` semantics into the codebase. In particular, there was https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100239 for `String`, `Vector` and `CowData`. Hopefully, sometime in the future, we'll get similar `move` constructors and assignments for `Variant`. The `SWAP` macro should be ready to accelerate these semantics.\r\n\r\nThe implementation of `std::swap` on my machine (macOS) looks like this:\r\n\r\n```c++\r\ntemplate <class _Tp>\r\ninline _LIBCPP_HIDE_FROM_ABI __swap_result_t<_Tp> _LIBCPP_CONSTEXPR_SINCE_CXX20 swap(_Tp& __x, _Tp& __y)\r\n    _NOEXCEPT_(is_nothrow_move_constructible<_Tp>::value&& is_nothrow_move_assignable<_Tp>::value) {\r\n  _Tp __t(std::move(__x));\r\n  __x = std::move(__y);\r\n  __y = std::move(__t);\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nIt could be trivially re-implemented in Godot as such:\r\n\r\n```c++\r\ntemplate <typename T>\r\ninline void __swap_tmpl(T &x, T &y) {\r\n\tT aux(std::move(x));\r\n\tx = std::move(y);\r\n\ty = std::move(aux);\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nHowever, since both `std::swap` and `std::move` are defined in `<utility>` (i.e. the include is needed anyway), I see no reason to reinvent the wheel (except maybe to make it `constexpr`?).","closed_by":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100367/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100367/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}